### Example: Generate test file for a table
### This endpoint generates a complete test.http file with example CRUD operations

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3200

### Generate test file for Products table
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tables/production/products/generate-tests

###

### Generate test file for Customers table  
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tables/sales/customers/generate-tests

###

### Instructions:
### 1. Run the generate-tests endpoint for your table
### 2. Copy the response content
### 3. Save it as a new .http file (e.g., products-test.http)
### 4. Run the authentication request first to get a token
### 5. Update the @token variable with the received token
### 6. Run the other requests to test CRUD operations
